From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Armada <noreply@armada.local>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 19:29:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] clk: qcom: gcc-sm8550: let the PCIe GDSCs collapse in suspend

Undo the effect of upstream 967e011013ed ("clk: qcom: gcc-sm8550: Do
not turn off PCIe GDSCs during gdsc_disable()"). With PWRSTS_RET_ON,
gdsc_disable() returns without touching the hardware, so the PCIe
controllers and PHYs stay powered through s2idle. A powered controller
still needs its system-NoC path, so the sleep set has to keep a NoC
bandwidth vote or the system-level low power mode never returns, and
that vote in turn keeps DDR out of self-refresh.

The RET_ON change dates from when pcie-qcom kept the link in L1ss across
non-S2RAM suspend. pcie-qcom now turns the link off (PME_Turn_Off, host
deinit, pwrctrl power-off) whenever D3cold is possible and retrains it on
resume, so the GDSCs can collapse. The Qualcomm downstream driver
(pci-msm) also disables both PCIe GDSCs in its clock deinit.
---
 drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sm8550.c | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sm8550.c b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sm8550.c
index 36a5b7de5..8c816c32b 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sm8550.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/qcom/gcc-sm8550.c
@@ -3003,7 +3003,7 @@ static struct gdsc pcie_0_gdsc = {
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "pcie_0_gdsc",
 	},
-	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_RET_ON,
+	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
 	.flags = VOTABLE | POLL_CFG_GDSCR | RETAIN_FF_ENABLE,
 };
 
@@ -3014,7 +3014,7 @@ static struct gdsc pcie_0_phy_gdsc = {
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "pcie_0_phy_gdsc",
 	},
-	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_RET_ON,
+	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
 	.flags = VOTABLE | POLL_CFG_GDSCR | RETAIN_FF_ENABLE,
 };
 
@@ -3025,7 +3025,7 @@ static struct gdsc pcie_1_gdsc = {
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "pcie_1_gdsc",
 	},
-	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_RET_ON,
+	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
 	.flags = VOTABLE | POLL_CFG_GDSCR | RETAIN_FF_ENABLE,
 };
 
@@ -3036,7 +3036,7 @@ static struct gdsc pcie_1_phy_gdsc = {
 	.pd = {
 		.name = "pcie_1_phy_gdsc",
 	},
-	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_RET_ON,
+	.pwrsts = PWRSTS_OFF_ON,
 	.flags = VOTABLE | POLL_CFG_GDSCR | RETAIN_FF_ENABLE,
 };
 
